### HeroMaker API (/api/v1) by hand
### Every client calls /api/v1: app/api/v1.py (heroes), app/api/v1_account.py
### (signing in, credits). Agent docs: /llms.txt. Human docs: /developers.
### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@apiBase = {{baseUrl}}/api/v1
@token =
@creationId =

### ============================================
### 1. AUTHENTICATION
### ============================================

### Signup new user
POST {{apiBase}}/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "testpass123",
  "name": "Test User"
}

### Login
POST {{apiBase}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "testpass123"
}

### Get current user (requires token)
GET {{apiBase}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Credits left and what a hero costs
GET {{apiBase}}/account
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### 2. COST AND TIME (no auth)
### ============================================

### Each stage's cost and typical length, and the whole hero's
GET {{apiBase}}/estimates

### The painting styles
GET {{apiBase}}/styles

### ============================================
### 3. MAKE A HERO
### ============================================

### Upload a drawing and start it now
POST {{apiBase}}/heroes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="drawing"; filename="test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test-image.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

Test Hero
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### Upload only (status "draft"); start it below
POST {{apiBase}}/heroes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="drawing"; filename="test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test-image.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="start"

false
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### Start it (or make it again)
POST {{apiBase}}/heroes/{{creationId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Try again from a stage: cleanup, painting, model, rig, avatar
POST {{apiBase}}/heroes/{{creationId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from_stage": "model"
}

### Run one stage on its own
POST {{apiBase}}/heroes/{{creationId}}/stages/painting/run
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Stop the stage being made (its charge stays)
POST {{apiBase}}/heroes/{{creationId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### 4. READ HEROES
### ============================================

### One hero: status, stages, progress, time left, files
GET {{apiBase}}/heroes/{{creationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### The account's heroes, newest first
GET {{apiBase}}/heroes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### The gallery: featured (anyone), mine, all (admins)
GET {{apiBase}}/gallery?view=featured

### ============================================
### 5. ERROR CASES
### ============================================

### Unknown stage
POST {{apiBase}}/heroes/{{creationId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from_stage": "invalid_stage"
}

### Someone else's, or no such hero (404)
POST {{apiBase}}/heroes/invalid-id-12345/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### 6. HEALTH & UTILITY
### ============================================

### Health check (no auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### API index
GET {{apiBase}}
